From e614dcc99adac9ea1c53cdc567c59e6346b84f05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheCryptoDonkey <TheCryptoDonkey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: dashboard login and onboarding with a linked signer

Log in to the dashboard by approving on a linked signer: a button above
the password form when a signer is enrolled, the code shown large, and
an approve-on-your-signer option beside the TOTP code on 2FA accounts.
Adds an optional Connect a signer step after password setup, a Login
signers section in Settings, a Linked badge and Link a signer button on
the Identities page, and signer-aware wording in the signing consent
dialog. Mock backend entries cover every new method.
